[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2920304395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106909#issuecomment-2920304395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106909","id":2920304395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uEE8L","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T18:58:12Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T18:58:12Z","body":"> Android 10 Smartphone\n\n@fossFriend This is not sufficient information; please update the issue with the full set of info about the device to help us narrow down the issue.\n\nAlso validate that the issue you're experiencing is not covered in the known issues / limitations - https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.html#limitations-known-issues","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2920304395/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2921921248","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106909#issuecomment-2921921248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106909","id":2921921248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uKPrg","user":{"login":"fossFriend","id":199567962,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-UqWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199567962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend","html_url":"https://github.com/fossFriend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T10:17:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T10:20:07Z","body":"Updated OS in original post. See \"Updated\" label.\n\nIt does not matter which project is in editor, the issue is lack of editor persistence between app tabbing/switching.\n\nI mostly do edits in Acode editor while Godot editor is running.\n\nSo from Godot with a scene loaded, I switch to Acode, do an edit, but when I come back it is hit and miss if;\n\n1) Editor is still loaded.\n2) Editor boots from splash and restores last scene.\n3) Editor boots from splash but goes to project screen. Then have to launch the scene again.\n\nSometimes I switch to YouTube to watch a piece of a godot tutorial or browse the web.\n\nWhen I come back, anyone of the above 3 occurs.\n\nPragmatic and efficient workflow would be number 1, hands down.\n\nWatching the splash screen load multiple times during an editing session between app switching, is quite tedious.\n\nLet me know if you want more.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2921921248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922462495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106909#issuecomment-2922462495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106909","id":2922462495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uMT0f","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T13:52:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T13:52:59Z","body":"That's not normal behavior as many users, myself included, are able to multitask between the editor and other apps without losing the current progress. \n\nSo there are a couple things possibly at play: \n- either your device doesn't have enough memory, in which case Android will kill the app that's in the background when running low on memory\n- or the number of apps in the background has been restricted through a device setting\n\nI did a quick Google search and it seems the latter is likely on your device, so I'd suggest trying out the suggestions from the search\n\nhttps://www.google.com/search?q=huawei+p30+lite+kills+apps+in+background\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922462495/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922563670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106909#issuecomment-2922563670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106909","id":2922563670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uMshW","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T14:32:20Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T14:32:20Z","body":"Can you share how you have Acode set up to work with Godot scripts? (Asking b/c I have both Acode and Godot myself but I use Acode for JS, not Godot, so far)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922563670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922793298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106909#issuecomment-2922793298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106909","id":2922793298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uNklS","user":{"login":"fossFriend","id":199567962,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-UqWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199567962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend","html_url":"https://github.com/fossFriend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T16:06:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T22:23:29Z","body":"> That's not normal behavior as many users, myself included, are able to multitask between the editor and other apps without losing the current progress.\n> \n> So there are a couple things possibly at play:\n> \n> * either your device doesn't have enough memory, in which case Android will kill the app that's in the background when running low on memory\n> * or the number of apps in the background has been restricted through a device setting\n> \n> I did a quick Google search and it seems the latter is likely on your device, so I'd suggest trying out the suggestions from the search\n> \n> https://www.google.com/search?q=huawei+p30+lite+kills+apps+in+background\n\nOkay. Thanks. Will close this issue.\n\n> Can you share how you have Acode set up to work with Godot scripts? (Asking b/c I have both Acode and Godot myself but I use Acode for JS, not Godot, so far)\n\nWill be closing this issue based on reply from m4gr3d, but will answer your question first.\n\nNo special setup. The gdscript editor is too small to use from a phone, so to create a new gdscript to edit, switch to Acode, create a new file then save into the goofot projects directory that is currently open in Godot.\n\nOn switching back to Godot, the editor either refreshes itself if the file of new, or prompts for a quick reload about the changed file. Then resume from there.\n\nAcode is just easier to use for editing on small screens.\n\nUpdate: For tab stops I installed NextApp Technical Keyboard.\n\nThanks for the question.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922793298/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922796972","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106909#issuecomment-2922796972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106909","id":2922796972,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uNles","user":{"login":"fossFriend","id":199567962,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-UqWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199567962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend","html_url":"https://github.com/fossFriend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fossFriend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T16:08:19Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T16:08:19Z","body":"> That's not normal behavior as many users, myself included, are able to multitask between the editor and other apps without losing the current progress.\n> \n> So there are a couple things possibly at play:\n> \n> * either your device doesn't have enough memory, in which case Android will kill the app that's in the background when running low on memory\n> * or the number of apps in the background has been restricted through a device setting\n> \n> I did a quick Google search and it seems the latter is likely on your device, so I'd suggest trying out the suggestions from the search\n> \n> https://www.google.com/search?q=huawei+p30+lite+kills+apps+in+background\n\nThanks m4gr3d\n\nWill go with your observations.\n\nLooking forward to 4.5 official.\n\nThe Godot team has done a really good job.\n\nClosing this issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922796972/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused"